<title>USA: Elsinore effective date extended.</title>
<headline>Elsinore effective date extended.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elsinore Corp said the effective date for its confirmed plan of reorganization has been extended by court order until March 31.</p>
<p>As originally confirmed, the company's plan of reorganization, pending in U.S. Bankruptcy Court, was to be fully effective on or before December 31.</p>
<p>The court's order was entered in response to a motion made by the State of Nevada Gaming Authority, and supported by the company, its units and the informal committee of bondholders as proponents of the plan of reorganization.</p>
